  "shortName": "6551 ACIA",
  "vendor": "MOS / Rockwell / WDC",
  "category": "ic",
  "summary": "Serial port for a 6502 system: a full UART with its own baud rate generator, so one crystal gives you every standard rate.",
  "logic": "5 V",
  "package": "PDIP-28",
  "keywords": [
    "6551",
